        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela ijanza lya-Jehova lyakalemena ba-Asidodi, wakabanyonyoona akubaumya zyuute boonse baku-Asidodi abakucisi ceengelede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu ba-Asidodi nibakabona boobu bakaamba bati, Ibbokesi lya-Leza waIsrayeli talyeelede kusyaala kulindiswe, pe, nkaambo ijanza lyakwe lyatulemena iswe a-Leza wesu Dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo bakatuma kuyoobunganya bami boonse baba-Filisti kulimbabo, bakaamba bati, Tulicite buti ibbokesi lyaLeza wa-Israyeli? Nkabela bakaamba bati, Ibbokesi lya-Leza wa-Israyeli lilongele ku-Gati. Mpawo bakalonzya ibbokesi lya-Leza wa-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
