        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakatuma kuyoobunganya bami boonse baba-Filisti, bakaamba bati, Amutume ibbokesi lya-Leza waba-Israyeli kuti libweede kulimbabo, kuti litatujayi iswe abantu besu, nkaambo kakuli lupyopyongano lwakujaya kumunzi woonse, ijanza lya-Leza lyakaulemena loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
